('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',11,'Mont d''Arbois sits at the centre of the Megève network, a short ride from each side.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.2.why'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',12,'The steeper skiing is scattered in small pockets.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.2.limit'),
