('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',42,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.10.fit'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',43,'{{f:F000548}} Michelin stars in Megève and another at Saint-Nicolas.',array['F000548']::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.10.why'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',44,'The best known tables are expensive and book up.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.10.limit'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',45,'Looking for après','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.11.who'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',46,'Mixed','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.11.fit'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',47,'La Folie Douce on Mont Joux and late clubs in Megève.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.11.why'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',48,'Megève''s evenings are polished rather than wild.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.11.limit'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',49,'Non skiers','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.12.who'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',50,'Good fit','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.12.fit'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',51,'A pedestrian village centre, Le Palais, horse drawn carriages and the thermal spa at Le Fayet.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.12.why'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',52,'Each activity is paid for separately.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.rows.12.limit'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','heading',1,'The catches','{}'::text[],'review','loader','fit.catchesH3'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','fit','line',53,'Height is the main one. The lifts start between {{f:F000570|n}} and {{f:F000590}}, most of them stop below 2,000 m, and three of the last five seasons were poor at 1,600 m in the weather model. The pass also covers more than the skis can reach: the two networks do not meet, and Les Contamines is a drive away.',array['F000570','F000590']::text[],'review','loader','fit.catches'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','compare','heading',0,'The other large areas within reach of Geneva','{}'::text[],'review','loader','compare.h2'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','compare','para',0,'Set against its neighbours, Évasion Mont Blanc is the smallest of the four on skiresort.com''s measure, with {{f:F000508}} of linked piste against {{f:F000516}} in the Portes du Soleil and {{f:F000523}} in the Grand Massif, and only the Portes du Soleil tops out lower. Its share of difficult piste, {{f:F000514}}, matches the Grand Massif''s.',array['F000508','F000514','F000516','F000523']::text[],'review','loader','compare.paras.0'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','compare','para',1,'Its six day pass is the cheapest of the four at {{f:F000535}}, against {{f:F000531}} in the Portes du Soleil and {{f:F000057}} in Les 3 Vallées. Its grid cell has more modelled snow at 1,600 m than the Portes du Soleil and Les 3 Vallées, and less than the Grand Massif.',array['F000057','F000531','F000535']::text[],'review','loader','compare.paras.1'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','compare','caption',0,'Four linked areas within reach of Geneva','{}'::text[],'review','loader','compare.caption'),
