('area:evasion-mont-blanc','compare','note',0,'Size, lifts, heights and grade split: skiresort.com listings for <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/megeve-saint-gervais/">Megève and Saint-Gervais</a> and <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-portes-du-mont-blanc-combloux-megeve-le-jaillet-la-giettaz/">Les Portes du Mont-Blanc</a> (added together for Évasion Mont Blanc, without Les Contamines), <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-portes-du-soleil-morzine-avoriaz-les-gets-chatel-morgins-champery/">Portes du Soleil</a>, <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/le-grand-massif-flaine-les-carroz-morillon-samoens-sixt/">Grand Massif</a> and <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-3-vallees-val-thorens-les-menuires-meribel-courchevel/">Les 3 Vallées</a>. Prices: <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/tarifs-forfaits-de-ski/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes/tarifs-forfaits-ski-alpes-du-nord">Alti-Mag</a>, 2026/27 high season, indicative. Snowfall: ERA5 via the Open-Meteo historical weather API, one grid cell per area adjusted to 1,600 m; the cells are about 20 to 30 km across, so the figures describe regions, not single resorts. Road: fastest route from Geneva airport to the main villages by the OSRM router.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','compare.note'),
