('area:evasion-mont-blanc','explore','line',9,'Pages for Megève, Saint-Gervais, Combloux and La Giettaz come next, with the runs, ski schools, restaurants and places to stay that this page leaves out.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','explore.2.text'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',0,'Which resorts count','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.items.0.dt'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',1,'Megève, Saint-Gervais, Saint-Nicolas-de-Véroce, Combloux and La Giettaz, the linked resorts on the Évasion Mont-Blanc pass, split into the eight sectors that a skier meets on the ground. Les Contamines-Hauteluce and Cordon share the pass but are not linked on skis, and sharing the pass is recorded separately from being linked by lift and piste.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.items.0.dd'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',2,'How links were checked','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.items.1.dt'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',3,'A sector counts as linked only when a route of lifts and pistes reaches it in the OpenStreetMap data. Drag lifts run one way and gondolas and cable cars may be ridden down. The near flat Charmots drag between La Giettaz and Le Jaillet keeps its mapped direction, which the elevation model reads the wrong way round. A link is critical when closing one lift on it cuts routes that no other lift replaces. The model has not yet been checked against the official 2026/27 piste map.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.items.1.dd'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',4,'Piste totals','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.items.2.dt'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',5,'Operator and measured figures are both shown and never averaged. The measured figure adds the skiresort.com listings for Megève and Saint-Gervais and for Les Portes du Mont-Blanc. Mapped piste from OpenStreetMap is used only to compare sectors and grades.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.items.2.dd'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',6,'Comparisons','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.items.3.dt'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',7,'The four areas compared use the same source for each row, so a figure can be set against its neighbour.','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.items.3.dd'),
