('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','heading',0,'Figures that do not agree','{}'::text[],'review','loader','method.conflictsH3'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',52,'Alti-Mag counts {{f:F000496}} lifts on the pass and the Saint-Gervais tourist office {{f:F000497}}, while skiresort.com lists {{f:F000509}} on the linked slopes without Les Contamines and the map data holds {{f:F000551}} main lifts. Alti-Mag gives the height range as {{f:F000498|n}} to {{f:F000499}}, the tourist office tops it at {{f:F000500}}, and skiresort.com at {{f:F000511}}. Alti-Mag closes Les Portes du Mont-Blanc on {{f:F000504|dm}} on its domain page and on {{f:F000505|dm}} on its La Giettaz page. The tourist office lists a week pass at {{f:F000540}} beside the six day price of {{f:F000535}}. This page names each source alongside its figure.',array['F000496','F000497','F000498','F000499','F000500','F000504','F000505','F000509','F000511','F000535','F000540','F000551']::text[],'review','loader','method.conflicts'),
('area:evasion-mont-blanc','method','line',53,'Research of 24 October 2026. Size, runs, lifts and passes: <a href="https://www.alti-mag.com/domaines-skiables/evasion-mont-blanc">Alti-Mag</a>, <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/?p=8172">Guide Ski for Megève</a>, <a href="https://tourism.saintgervais.com/i-want-to/an-activity/evasion-mont-blanc-ski-resort-saint-gervais-les-bains-en-4359378/">the Saint-Gervais tourist office</a> and <a href="https://www.skiinfo.fr/alpes-du-nord/saint-gervais-mont-blanc/forfaits-de-ski.html">Skiinfo</a>. Measured size and grades: skiresort.com for <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/megeve-saint-gervais/">Megève and Saint-Gervais</a> and <a href="https://www.skiresort.com/en/ski-resort/les-portes-du-mont-blanc-combloux-megeve-le-jaillet-la-giettaz/">Les Portes du Mont-Blanc</a>. History: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meg%C3%A8ve">Wikipedia on Megève</a>. Network, bases, routes and lift heights: a graph of {{f:F000550}} lifts and {{f:F000553}} piste sections from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap</a> (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL), with heights from the Copernicus 90 m elevation model via <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/elevation-api">Open-Meteo</a>. Snowfall: ERA5 reanalysis via the <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/historical-weather-api">Open-Meteo historical weather API</a> (CC BY 4.0). Road distances: <a href="https://project-osrm.org/">OSRM</a>. Facts from operators, measurements, model results and estimates are kept apart in the research files, and conflicting figures are listed above rather than averaged.',array['F000550','F000553']::text[],'review','loader','method.sources');
